'''Hallowindy''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] event [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]]. She is the anti-[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Windy]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 229
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Hallowindy
|name2 = Hallowindy, type α
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hallowindy, type α''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Similar to other seasonal ubers, Hallowindy is not your best option as a generalist due to her rather poor DPS, although because of her decent range, she can serve decently as a backliner if properly protected. As for her niche, she excels against any midranged Alien enemies such as [[Ursamajor]], but can have a bad time against [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]] because her long attack animation can easily be interrupted by a [[Warp]]. Her slow speed doesn't make it any better as it takes a very long time for her to get back to the frontlines.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker}}

