==Trivia==
*[[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] increased Hallowindy's HP, attack, movement speed and range.
*Prior to [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]], Hallowindy's Evolved Form was named "Hallowindy α".
*There is a typo in Hallowindy, type α's description: "when its least expected" instead of "when it's least expected".
*Not counting [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Evangelist Cat]] or [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|Collaboration Cats]], Hallowindy and [[Spooky Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Spooky Thundia]] are tied for the oldest existing Uber Rare Cats without [[True Form]]s.

